  "text": "[NDBG.22.2.1] When a breakpoint fires in the leader tier:\n1. The leader pauses immediately and emits `stopped`.\n2. The leader sends a `ds/pauseRequested` notification to all\n   followers in the group.\n3. Each follower finishes its current pump cycle — a bounded latency\n   window, at most one cycle — then pauses and emits `stopped`.\n4. The IDE shows a `⚠ pause pending` indicator on follower threads\n   until they reach their pause point.\n\n",
